        <briefdescription>
<para>Determine the next active object eligible for execution. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Evaluates the current set of ready active objects and selects the highest-priority one that can preempt the currently running context, considering both the scheduler lock and preemption threshold.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>This function shall be called within a critical section.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>The priority of the next active object to run, or 0 if no activation is required. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>This function is called within a critical section.</para>
</simplesect>
